[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1982","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1982.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1512","title":"AMaViS virus_scanner 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"AMaViS 病毒扫描器 0.2.0-pre4 及更早版本存在命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标邮件服务器发送包含 shell 元字符的恶意邮件，将特制载荷置于 Reply-To 字段中，当 AMaViS 处理该邮件时即可触发命令执行，以 root 权限在系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可完全控制受影响服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1512"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:35Z","remediation":"升级 AMaViS 至 0.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 reply-to 字段的 shell 元字符转义问题。如无法升级，在调用 sendmail 或 amavis 的 Perl 脚本中，对 reply-to、from、subject 等用户可控邮件头字段使用 quotemeta() 函数进行转义后再传入 shell 命令，并确保禁用以 root 身份运行扫描进程的配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93219846414732&w=2","http://www.amavis.org/ChangeLog.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/527","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2349","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5dccbdd02e04ed15263189c9e9adec0bd125446a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1512.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1512","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1512.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6471e48aab3adc28479bf4c8fa1d38ad4787a75a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1512.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db7261396795ee10e4834f0fdf94aec36b0936ff/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xx34-wh4m-w39f/GHSA-xx34-wh4m-w39f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1512.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3a4ab5fd-0a12-4deb-9b2e-309b313a0f6e.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--3a4ab5fd-0a12-4deb-9b2e-309b313a0f6e.owl","https://github.com/JackRobert94464/RL-Honeypot/blob/f3b5fce36c605cae51854ec9770537fdb7114f05/Development/TPG-Data/htpg_mini.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1982.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1900","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1324","title":"HP OpenVMS VAXstations 登录失败账户锁定机制绕过漏洞","description":"Open VMS VAXstations 系统在配置 DECwindows 或 MOTIF 图形界面环境时，存在账户锁定机制失效的安全漏洞。当用户登录失败次数超过设定的阈值后，系统未能正确禁用该账户的访问权限，导致远程攻击者可以持续进行暴力密码猜测攻击，绕过认证限制获取系统访问权限。该漏洞影响 Open VMS 5.3 至 5.5-2 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1324"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:11Z","remediation":"升级 Open VMS 至 5.5-2-H1 或更高版本，该版本已修复登录失败阈值检测失效问题。如无法升级，在 SYSGEN 中设置 LGI_BRK_TERM 和 LGI_BRK_DISUSER 参数为启用状态，并配置系统安全审计策略监控异常登录行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/d-06.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7225","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1324.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1324.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1324","https://github.com/bb1nfosec/Information-Security-Tasks/blob/0846d08ea855932ba25bf194c288b16f16d75550/feeds/2026-06-07.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1324.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1324.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5r36-3w36-p2fp/GHSA-5r36-3w36-p2fp.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_200_300.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87872/info.html","https://github.com/jmohitz/SECAI/blob/33119e592f944e313664a5f75ae76284ea4b3fe8/data/CWE/307.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1888","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1888.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1293","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_proxy 畸形FTP命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.2.5 及更早版本中的 mod_proxy 模块存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的畸形 FTP 命令请求，触发代理模块在处理时发生段错误导致进程崩溃（dump core），从而使 Apache 服务无法继续正常处理请求。该漏洞影响 Apache 1.2.5 及之前所有版本，攻击者只需发送恶意构造的 FTP 请求即可造成服务中断，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1293"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:07Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.x 或更高版本（Apache 1.2.x 已停止维护）。如无法升级，在 httpd.conf 中移除或注释 `LoadModule proxy_module` 禁用 mod_proxy 模块，并限制 FTP 出站连接以缓解恶意 FTP 命令攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88413292830649&w=2","http://www.apache.org/info/security_bulletin_1.2.5.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1293.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1293","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1293.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1293.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/high/Apache%E7%9A%84mod_proxy%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-1999-1293).html","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/1xxx/cve-1999-1293.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1293.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001016.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b57e5b05-d1d6-4263-bf39-3df1599fd25f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1888.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1809","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1809.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1246","title":"Microsoft Site Server 3.0 Direct Mailer 敏感信息明文存储漏洞","description":"Microsoft Site Server 3.0 的 Direct Mailer 功能存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该功能将用户域名和密码以纯文本形式保存在 TMLBQueue 网络共享中，且该共享的默认权限设置不安全，允许远程攻击者通过访问该网络共享读取明文凭据，进而获取系统特权或进一步横向移动。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1246"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:01Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft KB229972 安全更新，该补丁修复了 Direct Mailer 组件明文存储凭据的问题。如无法安装补丁，手动收紧 TMLBQueue 网络共享的 ACL 权限，仅允许授权管理员访问，并启用 SMB 签名防止中间人窃取。建议升级至 Site Server 4.0 或迁移至更现代的替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/Q229/9/72.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2068","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1246","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1246.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1246.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-99cm-v3cq-wf9j/GHSA-99cm-v3cq-wf9j.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1246.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87849/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bcb834d4-2dd0-4c27-9456-4d8219890aab.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1809.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1800","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1233","title":"Microsoft IIS 域名解析访问限制漏洞","description":"IIS 4.0 的域名解析模块存在访问限制绕过漏洞。当攻击者的 IP 地址无法正常反向解析到 DNS 域名时，IIS 服务器未能对初始会话请求施加正确的访问限制检查，导致攻击者可绕过基于域名或 IP 地址的访问控制策略，获取非授权资源的访问权限。该漏洞影响 Microsoft IIS 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，从而降低服务器安全性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1233"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:00Z","remediation":"立即将 IIS 4.0 升级至 Windows 2000 自带的 IIS 5.0 或更高版本（IIS 6.0+），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。若无法升级，请在 IIS 管理器中禁用\"域名解析\"功能，或限制匿名用户访问策略，仅允许已解析的 IP 地址建立会话。另外建议在网络层配置反向 DNS 校验，拒绝未通过域名解析的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/Q241/5/62.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/657","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-039","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3306","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1233.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1233","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1233.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1233.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-53c2-2qjx-38qh/GHSA-53c2-2qjx-38qh.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/1xxx/cve-1999-1233.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1233.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f8160a66-e7e6-44ab-9c71-410f00677cdc.json","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1800.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1709","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1127","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Named Pipes Over RPC 资源耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 的远程过程调用（RPC）服务在处理命名管道（Named Pipes Over RPC）连接时存在资源管理缺陷，未能正确关闭无效的命名管道 RPC 连接。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标系统发起一系列包含畸形数据的连接请求，由于系统无法及时释放这些失败连接所占用的资源，最终导致系统资源（如内存、句柄等）被持续耗尽，引发拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响运行 Windows NT 4.0 的服务器与工作站，攻击仅需网络可达目标主机的 RPC 端口，无需任何凭据即可远程触发，利用方式是通过反复建立并发送畸形数据连接使目标系统资源枯竭而停止响应。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1127"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:46Z","remediation":"立即安装微软发布的 Windows NT 4.0 安全补丁（SP4 及之后补丁包，对应修复\"Named Pipes Over RPC\"漏洞的更新），通过 Windows Update 或手动部署补丁程序。如无法立即打补丁，应在边界防火墙或路由器上过滤 135、139、445 等 RPC/NetBIOS 端口的入站连接，并仅允许受信任内网主机访问命名管道服务，以缓解远程资源耗尽攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/Q195/7/33.asp","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/523.php","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-017","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/712a40967986b700313860b08048435be4fa9839/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1127.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1127","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1127.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24512263eb77d6af2cecd67bd2460f761fc94bea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1127.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fjjp-8g8w-55f2/GHSA-fjjp-8g8w-55f2.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x87000/86274/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--104a9cd6-dbd0-4dfc-807e-78202b058454.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1127.json","https://github.com/fklement/acema_oran/blob/096561d274c61aab60b54a37c9ceb0c29a73e6fb/O-Cloud%20-%20Data%20Gathering.ipynb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1708","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1094","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.01 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含特制长 URL 的链接，利用 \"mk:\" 协议触发缓冲区溢出，从而在用户浏览器中执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 Internet Explorer 4.01 及更早版本，攻击者需诱导用户点击恶意链接，无需其他认证条件，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1094"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:42Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告中提供的修补程序（KB 文章 Q176697），该补丁修复了 Internet Explorer 中 mk: 协议处理程序的长 URL 缓冲区溢出问题。鉴于 IE 4.01 及更早版本已停止技术支持，建议升级到受支持的 Microsoft Edge 浏览器；如无法升级，可通过注册表禁用 mk: 协议处理器，在 HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\mk\\shell\\open\\command 中将默认值清空作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88480839506155&w=2","http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q176/6/97.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/917","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1094.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1094","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1094.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1094.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wcrg-6ghq-6288/GHSA-wcrg-6ghq-6288.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88085/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1094.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000992.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1708.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1708.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1708.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1706","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1087","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4 无点IP地址安全区域绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4 在处理 URL 中的无点 IP 地址（32 位数字）时存在解析错误漏洞，将此类数字错误解析为主机名而非 IP 地址，导致浏览器对结果网页应用本地 Intranet 区域安全策略而非 Internet 区域策略。远程攻击者可通过构造包含无点 IP 地址的恶意 URL 诱导用户访问，绕过 IE 的 Internet 区域安全限制，在本地 Intranet 权限下执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1087"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:41Z","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 5 或更高版本，该问题已在后续版本中修复。若无法升级，手动将 dotless IP 格式的 URL（如 http://1234567890/）加入受限制站点列表，并启用最高安全级别以阻止此类绕过行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q168/6/17.asp","http://www.microsoft.com/Windows/Ie/security/dotless.asp","http://www.osvdb.org/7828","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-016","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2209","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1087.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1087","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1087.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c1321b1a6b0cb3a4c18f791e2c8443742c0cb0b0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1087.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9rv3-rxw8-xr7c/GHSA-9rv3-rxw8-xr7c.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1087.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--99ba35f8-d4eb-4aae-be83-0d60e01586a1.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88079/info.html","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1687","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1687.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1055","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9123,\"outputTokens\":21,\"totalTokens\":10808}}","description":"Microsoft Excel 97 在执行工作表函数前不会向用户发出任何警告或确认提示。攻击者可在恶意构造的 Excel 文档中利用内置的 CALL 工作表函数加载并执行一个恶意的 DLL 动态链接库，从而在受害者系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Excel 97 版本，攻击条件为诱导用户打开特制的 Excel 文件，属于典型的恶意文档投递型代码执行漏洞，用户一旦打开文档即可能在无感知的情况下被远程控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1055"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:36Z","remediation":"将 Microsoft Excel 升级到 Office 2000 SR-1 或安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-022 提供的补丁，该补丁已禁止 CALL 函数加载外部 DLL。如暂时无法升级，可在组策略中禁用 Excel 加载宏与调用外部函数，并限制用户打开来自不可信来源的 Excel 文档，以避免通过恶意工作簿执行恶意 DLL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/179","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-018","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1737","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1055.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1055","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1055.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d0833866f347223eab80ef68cc3e2461a4e724d/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1055.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cx75-p9pm-2q97/GHSA-cx75-p9pm-2q97.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-356.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1055.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/windows.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1210","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1210.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1592","title":"Sun SunOS sendmail 5 未指明漏洞","description":"Sendmail 5 存在多个未指明安全漏洞，影响运行 Sun SunOS 4.1.3_U1 及 4.1.4 操作系统的系统。远程攻击者可在无需认证的情况下，通过低复杂度的攻击手段利用这些漏洞，对目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性造成部分影响。具体攻击向量和影响细节未完全公开，Sun 公司已发布安全补丁进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1592"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:47Z","remediation":"升级 sendmail 至 8.9.x 及以上版本（sendmail 8 系列重构了安全架构，默认关闭 wiz/debug 等危险命令），或迁移到 Postfix/Exim 等现代 MTA。对于 SunOS 4.1.x 系统，建议升级至 Solaris 8/9 并安装对应 sendmail 补丁簇（补丁 ID 109326-xx/109327-xx）。如无法升级，在 /etc/sendmail.cf 中设置 \"O PrivacyOptions=restrictqrun\" 并禁用 SMTP EXPN/VRFY 命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-22-00159-1","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/243","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1592.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1592","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1592.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1592.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m569-vmh5-cc9h/GHSA-m569-vmh5-cc9h.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1592.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--681a549b-698f-40b1-89e2-7e085cd30e90.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/123da3a025e41a87a2b5f10a435135d4edd28636/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--681a549b-698f-40b1-89e2-7e085cd30e90.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1210.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1207","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1207.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1590","title":"Muhammad A. Muquit wwwcount 目录遍历漏洞","description":"wwwcount（Count.cgi）2.3 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在 image 参数中构造 \"..\" 序列绕过路径限制，可读取服务器上任意 GIF 文件。CVSS 评分 3.5，危害等级低。该漏洞区别于 CVE-1999-0021，仅影响 GIF 文件读取，无法执行代码或读取其他类型文件。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1590"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:47Z","remediation":"立即升级至 wwwcount 2.3 以上版本，该漏洞仅存在于 2.3 版本。若厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的替代计数器方案（如 Matomo 或自研计数器）。在 cgi 脚本中严格过滤 image 参数中的 \"..\" 目录穿越序列，并对可读取文件路径做白名单校验，限制只允许访问指定目录下的 GIF 文件。此外，将 CGI 程序置于 chroot 环境或使用 Web 服务器沙箱隔离作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/bugtraq/1997/Oct/0058.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1590.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1590","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1590.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1590.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jfr4-hpqv-2pq4/GHSA-jfr4-hpqv-2pq4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87918/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1590.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001065.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1207.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1207.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1207.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1205","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1205.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1589","title":"IBM AIX 3.2 crontab 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 3.2 的 crontab 组件存在未指明安全漏洞，本地攻击者可通过未知攻击向量利用该漏洞提升权限至 root 用户，实现对系统的完全控制。由于漏洞细节未公开，攻击条件尚不明确，但攻击者需要具备本地系统访问权限方可利用，影响范围包括 AIX 3.2 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1589"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 AIX 至 4.1 或更高版本（IBM 已通过 APAR 补丁修复此漏洞），或限制 crontab 命令仅授权管理员使用，移除 /usr/bin/crontab 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/crontab）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1992-10.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/357","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1589.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1589","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1589.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1589.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j4jq-crhw-x9w5/GHSA-j4jq-crhw-x9w5.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1589.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a4264527-93ec-4449-abae-a0eb85812356.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt","https://github.com/xXRenzoElProXx/secdash/blob/f8567f96d1554fc10942b9c14b4840ffde38fe05/shared_data/ag9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1205.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1204","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1204.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1587","title":"Sun Solaris /usr/ucb/ps 本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"Solaris 8/9 系统中的 /usr/ucb/ps 工具存在本地信息泄露漏洞。本地攻击者可通过使用 -e 选项以查看任意进程的环境变量及敏感信息，导致其他用户的密码、密钥等机密数据被非授权获取。该漏洞影响 Solaris 8、9 及更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1587"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:46Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 官方补丁（SunSolve ID 102215），限制 `/usr/ucb/ps` 的访问权限，移除该文件的 setuid 位，仅授权管理员使用。建议升级到受支持的 Oracle Solaris 11 或迁移至其他现代操作系统，避免继续使用已停止安全更新的 Solaris 8/9。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/19426","http://securitytracker.com/id?1015833","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-102215-1","http://www.osvdb.org/24200","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/19662","http://www.sunmanagers.org/archives/1996/1383.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2006/1123","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/25460","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1470","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/2242","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1587.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1587.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1587","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/26267.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1587.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1587.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vrp4-j3rg-w647/GHSA-vrp4-j3rg-w647.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/solaris9_120240.nasl","https://github.com/cjac/NIST-NVD/blob/54a2c240455f1a25d6d620bf5d9ff1d0533949cb/lib/NIST/NVD/Query.pm","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2007/CVE-2007-0805.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1204.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1204.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1204.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1203","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1203.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1586","title":"Sun SunOS 4.1.x loadmodule 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1.x 系统中用于 xnews 的 loadmodule 程序存在环境变量过滤不严漏洞，由于未对环境变量进行正确过滤，本地攻击者可通过精心构造特定的环境变量触发该漏洞，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SunOS 4.1.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1586"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:46Z","remediation":"安装 CERT Advisory CA-1995-12 和 CIAC Bulletin G-02 中引用的 Sun 官方补丁程序。对于仍运行 SunOS 4.1.x 的系统，由于该版本已停止技术支持多年，建议尽快迁移至受支持的 Solaris 10/11 或更新版本。临时缓解措施包括：移除 xnews/loadmodule 的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/xnews），并严格限制本地用户的登录访问范围，仅允许受信用户操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1995-12.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/g-02.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/498","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1586.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1586","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1586.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1586.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8jjf-pj37-wq93/GHSA-8jjf-pj37-wq93.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0282.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1584.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000214.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/505c1bd5ff865ea4c9d17d5fc273b2a66d1df9ee/1999/CVE-1999-1586.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1203.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1201","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1585","title":"Sun Solaris 权限许可和访问控制漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 2.x 系统中的 rcS 和 mountall 程序在系统引导时，若 fsck 文件系统检查失败，会在系统控制台自动启动一个具有 root 权限的特权 shell。拥有物理访问权限的攻击者可利用此漏洞，在系统启动过程中通过控制台获取 root 用户完全控制权。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.4 之前版本，攻击条件要求物理接触目标主机。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1585"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:46Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Sun Solaris 2.x（2.4 之前版本）。升级到 Solaris 2.4 或更高版本即可修复，或安装 Sun 补丁 100124-01（对应 SunSolve 公告 ID 100124）。如无法立即升级，应加强物理访问控制，确保服务器控制台仅授权人员可接触，同时在 /etc/default/fsck 中配置 fsck 失败时不自动派生特权 shell。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-22-00124-1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-19